[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4023.046, "timestamp": "01:07:03", "text": "最后一刻了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4024.069, "timestamp": "01:07:04", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4027.19, "timestamp": "01:07:07", "text": "这感觉像是最后一刻才发生的事。 我真是恨透了它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4030.069, "timestamp": "01:07:10", "text": "。 如果我只有考学位考试的时候才能像这样集中精力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4033.029, "timestamp": "01:07:13", "text": "，我甚至都不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4036.801, "timestamp": "01:07:16", "text": "下个月该考什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4042.069, "timestamp": "01:07:22", "text": "我甚至不知道英语文学课我应该写什么主题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4052.63, "timestamp": "01:07:32", "text": "我一直只专注于这些事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4055.19, "timestamp": "01:07:35", "text": "如果我现在也能在英语上投入这么多精力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4057.75, "timestamp": "01:07:37", "text": "，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4061.19, "timestamp": "01:07:41", "text": "早就通过考试了，而且我也"}]